	// LU factorization (Doolittle-like scheme)
	//
	// We keep the original semantics but:
	//   * split the j-loop into two ranges per row (L-part and U-part)
	//     instead of a single loop with a branch on j<i, removing an
	//     inner-branch and improving ILP.
